  "description": "Lycia.Extensions provides transport-independent modules for the Lycia Saga framework:\n            - Fluent DI registration (AddLycia with ConfigureSaga, ConfigureEventBus, ConfigureRetry, ConfigureLogging)\n            - Built-in retry policies with Polly integration\n            - Configurable middleware slots (logging, tracing, retry, custom middlewares)\n            - Newtonsoft JSON serializer and Redis saga store\n            - Health check integration (IHealthCheck)\n\n            Transports and durable scheduling ship separately: Lycia.Extensions.RabbitMq,\n            Lycia.Extensions.Nats, Lycia.Extensions.Kafka, and Lycia.Extensions.Scheduling.\n            Keep your Saga setup modular, extensible, and production-grade. Add only the components you need.",
  "id": "Lycia.Extensions",
